sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Staff as Staff (CURATE_DATASET)
    participant UI as Staff Dataset (ecolink-web)
    participant Ctrl as StaffDatasetCurationController
    participant Svc as AiDatasetCurationService
    participant Zip as AiDatasetExportBuilder
    participant AiHttp as AiVisionHttpClient
    participant FastAPI as Ecolink.AiService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over Staff,DB: S-03: Dong goi Dataset Sticky Stratified Split 70/20/10, Export ZIP & FastAPI Sync

    Staff->>UI: Mo trang Tap du lieu kiem chung (/staff/dataset)
    UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/staff/ai-datasets
    Ctrl->>Svc: GetDatasetOverviewAsync()
    Svc->>DB: Query ai_dataset_items + ai_feedback_logs + ai_dataset_versions
    Svc->>Svc: Tinh ImbalanceRatio = MaxCount / MinCount & Canh bao > 2.5
    Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK AiDatasetDashboardDto

    Staff->>UI: Bam Dong goi phien ban moi (v1.1.0, 70/20/10, syncToAiService=true)
    UI->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/staff/ai-datasets/versions
    Ctrl->>Svc: CreateDatasetVersionAsync(staffId, req)
    Svc->>DB: Load chi cac mau VerifiedLabeled (BR-CLS-06)
    Svc->>Svc: Group by ImageSha256 -> Lock StickySplit cu -> Chia 70/20/10 phan tang cho mau moi (BR-CLS-07)
    Svc->>DB: BeginTransaction -> INSERT ai_dataset_versions & ai_dataset_version_items + Save StickySplit -> Commit
    opt req.SyncToAiService == true
        Svc->>AiHttp: CurateDatasetAsync(versionCode, items manifest)
        AiHttp->>FastAPI: POST /api/v1/datasets/curate
        FastAPI->>FastAPI: Assert train_sha256 & test_sha256 == rong & Ghi manifest.json
        alt AI Service Online
            FastAPI-->>AiHttp: 200 OK success=true
            Svc->>DB: UPDATE Status = SyncedToAi
        else AI Service Offline / Timeout
            AiHttp-->>Svc: success=false -> Giu Published + Gan aiSyncWarning
        end
    end
    Ctrl-->>UI: 201 Created (MSG-CLS-08)

    opt Tai goi huan luyen .zip (YOLO hoac ImageFolder)
        Staff->>UI: Chon dinh dang YOLO -> Bam Tai ZIP
        UI->>Ctrl: GET /api/v1/staff/ai-datasets/versions/{versionId}/export?format=yolo
        Ctrl->>Svc: ExportDatasetVersionAsync(staffId, versionId, format)
        Svc->>Zip: BuildZipAsync(version, items, yolo)
        Zip-->>Svc: bytes (.zip: data.yaml + labels/*.txt + manifest.json)
        Svc->>DB: INSERT audit_logs (EXPORT_AI_DATASET_VERSION)
        Ctrl-->>UI: 200 OK application/zip + Headers X-EcoLink-Message-Code: MSG-ADM-02
    end
